WEBVTT

1
00:00:37.126 --> 00:00:50.916
The movie is about to start...

2
00:00:52.417 --> 00:00:55.958
Spread love and joy
with people all around you.

3
00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:59.791
But don't spread your
legs too far in front

4
00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:03.500
Switch on your clockwork hearts
and tear glands

5
00:01:03.709 --> 00:01:07.166
But switch off mobile phones
and wailing children.

6
00:01:14.917 --> 00:01:16.625
Love in today's world..

7
00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:18.625
is like instant noodles.

8
00:01:18.626 --> 00:01:21.375
when it reaches your stomach,
it's mostly over

9
00:01:22.417 --> 00:01:24.250
Love in today's world
is born through Facebook

10
00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:26.000
Comes of age in backseats of cars

11
00:01:26.209 --> 00:01:29.125
And dies in cold legal courts

12
00:01:29.876 --> 00:01:33.458
Our story is about
a very different Kind of love

13
00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:37.166
A love filled with rainbows and dreams

14
00:01:37.417 --> 00:01:39.166
It's not a selfish kind of love

15
00:01:39.376 --> 00:01:41.000
It's not a messy kind of love

16
00:01:41.209 --> 00:01:44.291
It's a love that will tickle and linger

17
00:01:44.667 --> 00:01:54.666
The movie is about to start...

18
00:03:49.001 --> 00:03:51.583
I'd often complain to Barfi.

19
00:03:52.959 --> 00:03:55.875
That I didn't have a single
good photograph of him.

20
00:03:58.001 --> 00:04:00.375
But his answer was
always the same.

21
00:04:02.876 --> 00:04:04.833
I'll send you one before I die.

22
00:04:05.834 --> 00:04:07.000
You can have that framed.

23
00:04:13.417 --> 00:04:15.208
And true to his word...

24
00:04:16.292 --> 00:04:18.625
Barfi fulfilled his last promise.

25
00:04:31.417 --> 00:04:33.625
Since i was a child,
my idea of love was...

26
00:04:35.126 --> 00:04:36.750
to Live together...

27
00:04:38.001 --> 00:04:39.416
and die together.

28
00:04:42.084 --> 00:04:44.000
Just like my grandparents.

29
00:04:45.417 --> 00:04:48.250
I was ten,
when my grandpa passed away.

30
00:04:49.542 --> 00:04:53.125
And, a day Later,
my grandma also left us.

31
00:04:55.834 --> 00:04:57.791
I yearned for that kind of love.

32
00:05:00.584 --> 00:05:04.333
But Barfi was miles away in Darjeeling
breathing his last.

33
00:05:06.792 --> 00:05:09.750
i wasn't sure if i'd make it in time.

34
00:05:17.667 --> 00:05:18.958
I had learned from Barfi...

35
00:05:20.959 --> 00:05:23.500
that happiness is found in the little things.

36
00:05:25.584 --> 00:05:28.208
Even a bowl of water is enough
for ships to sail in.

37
00:05:29.501 --> 00:05:30.500
And if you truly believe...

38
00:05:31.376 --> 00:05:33.750
even paper birds can take flight.

39
00:05:37.209 --> 00:05:39.333
Barfi always stayed happy.

40
00:05:40.334 --> 00:05:42.125
And for some strange reason, unknowingly...

41
00:05:42.417 --> 00:05:46.500
I always brought difficulties
into his life.

42
00:05:49.167 --> 00:05:50.958
But he never complained...

43
00:05:53.001 --> 00:05:54.000
neither about me...

44
00:05:55.251 --> 00:05:56.708
nor about the difficulties.

45
00:06:55.959 --> 00:06:56.583
Barfi!

46
00:06:57.126 --> 00:06:59.000
ln the name of the law...

47
00:06:59.001 --> 00:07:00.083
l order you to stop!

48
00:07:02.084 --> 00:07:04.416
You fools!
what are you doing down there?

49
00:07:04.417 --> 00:07:06.000
He's on the roof!
Get up here now!

50
00:07:29.792 --> 00:07:30.625
- Barfi!

51
00:07:51.251 --> 00:07:52.750
Move out of the way!

52
00:09:41.376 --> 00:09:43.041
lnspector, there seems to be a mistake.

53
00:09:43.042 --> 00:09:46.500
This isn't a mistake.
And thank you very much, Mrs. sengupta.

54
00:09:46.501 --> 00:09:48.666
l wouldn't have caught him,
if you hadn't filed a complaint.

55
00:09:49.376 --> 00:09:50.666
Where are you taking him?

56
00:09:50.667 --> 00:09:51.916
London!

57
00:09:52.626 --> 00:09:54.708
Just joking, Mrs. sengupta.
we're taking him to Darjeeling.

58
00:09:54.709 --> 00:09:55.625
Let's go.

59
00:10:16.667 --> 00:10:18.541
Ma'am, sir is on the Line.

60
00:10:18.709 --> 00:10:20.375
He has called twice before.

61
00:10:29.834 --> 00:10:31.125
- Why did the cops come home?

62
00:10:31.959 --> 00:10:33.708
You didn't even bother informing me.

63
00:10:34.584 --> 00:10:35.375
- Hello!

64
00:10:36.501 --> 00:10:37.625
who is Barfi?

65
00:10:38.042 --> 00:10:39.208
- Who the helll is he to you?

66
00:10:40.042 --> 00:10:42.041
- We've never had cops in our house before...

67
00:10:42.834 --> 00:10:44.333
who is Barfi to me?

68
00:10:46.501 --> 00:10:49.333
i had no answer to Ranjeet's question.

69
00:10:49.709 --> 00:10:50.375
- shruti?

70
00:10:51.584 --> 00:10:54.791
After six years of being married to Ranjeet,
why was Barfi stilI important to me?

71
00:10:56.751 --> 00:10:57.875
Please give this to Ranjeet.

72
00:10:59.334 --> 00:11:03.125
That day, I broke all ties
to help Barfi.

73
00:11:09.542 --> 00:11:12.125
i guess, i could take such a
drastic step only because...

74
00:11:13.126 --> 00:11:15.750
I was still as deeply in love with Barfi...

75
00:11:15.751 --> 00:11:18.125
as i was the first time i met him.

76
00:11:20.334 --> 00:11:22.666
That was when my dad
had to relocate to DarjeeLing.

77
00:11:41.334 --> 00:11:43.375
Roll-up the window.
You'll catch a cold.

78
00:11:44.167 --> 00:11:47.041
- who will believe she's
getting married in three months?

79
00:11:59.667 --> 00:12:00.833
108...

80
00:12:01.417 --> 00:12:01.958
what is it?

81
00:12:02.751 --> 00:12:04.166
- Wait, Let me check.

82
00:12:23.751 --> 00:12:27.791
101-4, Government Bungallows, Hill Road?

83
00:12:27.792 --> 00:12:30.458
- Hillcart Road...
- Hillcart Road.

84
00:12:43.084 --> 00:12:43.541
ldiot!

85
00:14:20.292 --> 00:14:23.125
I don't want to talk about Barfi.

86
00:14:26.292 --> 00:14:30.791
I've spent half my life running after him.

87
00:14:33.667 --> 00:14:35.916
If it weren't for Barfi...

88
00:14:36.876 --> 00:14:39.458
I'd have retired as
the superintendent of Police.

89
00:14:41.126 --> 00:14:43.375
But now, I sell Homeopathy pills.

90
00:14:44.917 --> 00:14:46.125
Homeopathy!

91
00:14:51.709 --> 00:14:54.250
That rascal Barfi!

92
00:15:33.626 --> 00:15:37.041
Barfi spread love everywhere he went.

93
00:15:38.459 --> 00:15:42.208
But never wanted anything in return.

94
00:15:44.167 --> 00:15:46.875
No wonder he had so many well-wishers.

95
00:15:47.792 --> 00:15:49.583
Barfi and I were childhood friends.

96
00:15:50.001 --> 00:15:52.666
we had a lot of fun.

97
00:15:53.376 --> 00:15:54.916
He was hearing and speech impaired.

98
00:15:55.376 --> 00:15:57.625
But that didn't stop him
from being stubborn.

99
00:15:59.209 --> 00:16:00.916
He had a problem, though.

100
00:16:01.876 --> 00:16:03.083
he thought...

101
00:16:03.376 --> 00:16:05.750
peopLe would abandon him.

102
00:16:06.876 --> 00:16:10.000
That's why he always
put his close ones through a test.

103
00:17:06.542 --> 00:17:07.916
His father lovingly named him...

104
00:17:07.917 --> 00:17:09.458
Murphy, after the Murphy Radio Baby.

105
00:17:11.209 --> 00:17:13.416
lf anyone asked him his name, he'd say...

106
00:17:13.959 --> 00:17:14.791
Barfi!

107
00:20:34.209 --> 00:20:35.166
Barfi.

108
00:21:04.001 --> 00:21:05.583
You're wasting your time.

109
00:21:06.667 --> 00:21:07.791
I am engaged.

110
00:22:07.709 --> 00:22:08.916
Who sent this?

111
00:22:21.042 --> 00:22:24.166
- Look I've put the clock back
by 15 minutes

112
00:22:26.001 --> 00:22:28.583
- Assume that you and I never met.

113
00:22:29.084 --> 00:22:31.291
- And assume I never proposed to you.

114
00:22:32.334 --> 00:22:35.875
- Assume you have
made a new friend called Barfi.

115
00:22:36.376 --> 00:22:40.125
- And assume this friend is helping you
plan your wedding.

116
00:22:40.834 --> 00:22:41.708
How sweet!

117
00:22:42.792 --> 00:22:44.708
- And now that
you've assumed all of this,

118
00:22:44.709 --> 00:22:47.458
why don't you give in with a smiLe
and wave.

119
00:22:48.376 --> 00:22:49.708
So cute!

120
00:22:54.542 --> 00:22:57.583
l thought you told him you're engaged
so that he wouldn't bother you.

121
00:23:01.126 --> 00:23:01.791
He's very handsome.

122
00:23:02.167 --> 00:23:03.000
I know.

123
00:23:03.251 --> 00:23:04.875
All the girls at the university
had a crush on him.

124
00:23:05.709 --> 00:23:06.750
Love marriage?

125
00:23:10.417 --> 00:23:10.916
What?

126
00:23:12.251 --> 00:23:13.666
One fine day he waIked into the library...

127
00:23:14.001 --> 00:23:15.083
held my hand and asked me...

128
00:23:15.334 --> 00:23:16.083
"will you marry me?"

129
00:23:16.376 --> 00:23:16.750
Then?

130
00:23:17.751 --> 00:23:18.250
Then...

131
00:23:20.542 --> 00:23:22.583
I never hide anything from my mother.

132
00:23:23.584 --> 00:23:26.625
When I told her about Ranjeet...

133
00:23:26.626 --> 00:23:28.625
she only had one question.

134
00:23:29.042 --> 00:23:30.875
"What does his father do?"

135
00:23:32.626 --> 00:23:34.833
After coming to Darjeeling,
I don't Know why...

136
00:23:35.126 --> 00:23:38.541
I was happy to be away from Ranjeet.

137
00:24:06.084 --> 00:24:08.583
Barfi came along Like a gust of wind...

138
00:24:08.876 --> 00:24:11.500
and in a blink, i was swept
away from my ordinary Life...

139
00:24:11.501 --> 00:24:13.041
i didn't realise it.

140
00:24:14.501 --> 00:24:17.375
Barfi showed me how to live.

141
00:24:19.709 --> 00:24:22.375
How to be adventurous.

142
00:24:23.834 --> 00:24:26.416
And the most important lesson
I learned...

143
00:24:27.126 --> 00:24:29.250
is that the biggest risk in life...

144
00:24:30.209 --> 00:24:32.041
is never taking any risk at all.

145
00:24:59.042 --> 00:25:00.750
Excuse me... Inspector Dutta?

146
00:25:03.001 --> 00:25:04.458
You scoundrel!

147
00:25:04.792 --> 00:25:06.541
- Barfi the Great!

148
00:25:07.501 --> 00:25:09.375
You think you can
run from Inspector Dutta?

149
00:25:11.251 --> 00:25:12.000
Inspector...

150
00:25:12.292 --> 00:25:13.291
sir, please wait...

151
00:25:14.917 --> 00:25:15.875
Mrs. sengupta...

152
00:25:16.542 --> 00:25:17.166
from Calcutta!

153
00:25:18.042 --> 00:25:19.166
Didn't take you long to get here!

154
00:25:20.292 --> 00:25:21.541
Go on... beat him up.

155
00:25:21.834 --> 00:25:23.083
lnspector, he can't talk.

156
00:25:23.084 --> 00:25:24.458
Of course!

157
00:25:24.626 --> 00:25:25.500
I know that.

158
00:25:25.709 --> 00:25:27.541
we go back a long way.

159
00:25:28.834 --> 00:25:30.125
I think there's been a mistake.

160
00:25:30.334 --> 00:25:31.666
Don't you try to teach me.

161
00:25:32.084 --> 00:25:33.083
There's been no mistake.

162
00:25:33.292 --> 00:25:34.875
And if you want to help him...

163
00:25:35.126 --> 00:25:39.791
find someone who can
communicate with him!

164
00:25:39.792 --> 00:25:43.500
Because if I file a case against him
it will be all over for him.

165
00:25:43.917 --> 00:25:45.708
But what has he done?

166
00:25:46.459 --> 00:25:47.291
What has he done?

167
00:25:48.251 --> 00:25:49.500
What has he done!

168
00:25:49.501 --> 00:25:50.791
Look at this...

169
00:25:50.792 --> 00:25:52.708
My waist used to be 52 inches...

170
00:25:52.917 --> 00:25:53.916
and now it's 42 inches!

171
00:25:53.917 --> 00:25:55.166
And you ask me?

172
00:25:55.626 --> 00:25:55.916
Come!

173
00:25:57.542 --> 00:25:58.125
Come in.

174
00:26:01.626 --> 00:26:02.083
Take a look...

175
00:26:02.792 --> 00:26:03.625
- Here's your Barfi!

176
00:26:04.042 --> 00:26:04.666
What has he done?

177
00:26:05.584 --> 00:26:08.083
He has robbed a bank,
Mrs. sengupta.

178
00:26:08.542 --> 00:26:10.083
No, no, don't be surprised.

179
00:26:10.292 --> 00:26:11.583
The story does not end here.

180
00:26:12.209 --> 00:26:14.500
He kidnapped the grand-daughter...

181
00:26:14.501 --> 00:26:16.625
of the most respected man in Darjeeling!

182
00:26:18.876 --> 00:26:19.541
Here...

183
00:26:20.751 --> 00:26:21.458
This is...

184
00:26:22.334 --> 00:26:23.500
Ms. Jhillmill Chatterjee.

185
00:26:24.959 --> 00:26:25.625
Happy?

186
00:26:37.792 --> 00:26:39.916
She was only six...

187
00:26:41.584 --> 00:26:44.416
When Jhilmil's family
left her at Muskaan.

188
00:26:47.001 --> 00:26:48.625
Pure as can be...

189
00:26:49.209 --> 00:26:50.750
and soft as a cloud.

190
00:26:51.876 --> 00:26:55.541
Even back then
Autism was considered a disease.

191
00:26:55.751 --> 00:26:59.833
Her parents considered her
an embarrassment.

192
00:27:01.417 --> 00:27:02.833
I also heard that...

193
00:27:03.084 --> 00:27:07.583
her Mom tried to strangle her
under the influence of alcohol.

194
00:27:09.001 --> 00:27:13.583
And that's when her grand-dad
brought her to Muskaan.

195
00:27:14.459 --> 00:27:15.000
Since then...

196
00:27:15.209 --> 00:27:17.333
Muskaan was Jhilmil's home.

197
00:27:21.084 --> 00:27:22.541
You think you'll be able to
take care of her?

198
00:27:23.417 --> 00:27:25.458
How will you look after her?

199
00:27:26.459 --> 00:27:27.750
we have many servants.

200
00:27:30.042 --> 00:27:30.833
Servants!

201
00:27:31.334 --> 00:27:34.000
You see, her grandpa's health
has worsened.

202
00:27:34.501 --> 00:27:36.000
Perhaps his last few days.

203
00:27:36.834 --> 00:27:38.958
And he insists on seeing Jhilmil.

204
00:27:39.542 --> 00:27:42.708
You know very well,
that no one can dis-obey his order.

205
00:27:43.084 --> 00:27:45.791
Daju, you'll need to come.

206
00:27:56.542 --> 00:27:57.541
Jhilmil...

207
00:28:37.209 --> 00:28:42.250
Of all the kids at Muskaan,
Jhilmil was cLosest to Daju's heart.

208
00:28:43.626 --> 00:28:44.708
And why not?

209
00:28:45.459 --> 00:28:47.125
She was such an angel.

210
00:28:47.584 --> 00:28:51.666
if Daju had his way,
he'd never let go of Jhilmil.

211
00:28:53.084 --> 00:28:54.833
An alcoholic mother...

212
00:28:55.459 --> 00:28:57.583
a gambling good-for-nothing dad.

213
00:28:58.917 --> 00:29:04.125
Moreover, Jhilmil needed
special care and attention.

214
00:30:33.959 --> 00:30:34.666
Jung Bahadur!

215
00:31:02.334 --> 00:31:03.500
Barfi.

216
00:33:06.042 --> 00:33:07.541
Please, grandpa!

217
00:33:11.542 --> 00:33:11.958
Here.

218
00:33:59.584 --> 00:34:00.500
Shruti!

219
00:36:35.876 --> 00:36:37.250
You haven't been keeping well...

220
00:36:37.459 --> 00:36:38.666
but if you could sign these papers

221
00:36:38.667 --> 00:36:40.416
I'm not going to die...

222
00:36:41.792 --> 00:36:42.833
anytime soon.

223
00:37:50.001 --> 00:37:54.291
Don't laugh at me!

224
00:41:43.251 --> 00:41:44.041
What's his name?

225
00:41:45.584 --> 00:41:46.416
Whose name?

226
00:41:48.042 --> 00:41:48.916
whose?

227
00:41:53.584 --> 00:41:54.541
Barfi.

228
00:42:03.626 --> 00:42:09.458
when I was your age,
l went to school here in Darjeeling.

229
00:42:10.542 --> 00:42:11.125
I know.

230
00:42:12.376 --> 00:42:14.750
Well, there's something you don't know.

231
00:42:15.501 --> 00:42:16.000
What?

232
00:42:22.501 --> 00:42:23.833
See that man...

233
00:42:25.292 --> 00:42:26.375
in the blue sweater?

234
00:42:26.542 --> 00:42:27.125
Yes.

235
00:42:29.126 --> 00:42:30.416
He's my friend's brother.

236
00:42:31.334 --> 00:42:33.250
He was very handsome back then.

237
00:42:34.126 --> 00:42:35.541
l was crazy about him.

238
00:42:36.959 --> 00:42:39.333
And I wanted to elope with him.

239
00:42:40.959 --> 00:42:41.458
And then?

240
00:42:43.042 --> 00:42:44.916
l was at the railway station...

241
00:42:45.251 --> 00:42:46.458
with a ticket in my hand.

242
00:42:47.459 --> 00:42:49.000
And the train Left the station.

243
00:42:50.126 --> 00:42:51.250
l didn't go with him.

244
00:42:54.376 --> 00:42:56.458
since your father got transferred here...

245
00:42:57.959 --> 00:42:59.750
whenever it's possible...

246
00:43:01.042 --> 00:43:02.500
l come here.

247
00:43:03.792 --> 00:43:05.333
And look at him from a distance.

248
00:43:06.834 --> 00:43:09.416
I am scared to imagine...

249
00:43:10.417 --> 00:43:12.458
what if I had eloped with him?

250
00:43:13.709 --> 00:43:16.000
what would my life be Like now?

251
00:43:17.751 --> 00:43:19.708
what life would I
be able to offer you?

252
00:43:21.834 --> 00:43:23.708
The crossroads you are at right now...

253
00:43:24.501 --> 00:43:25.958
l had turned away from.

254
00:43:30.959 --> 00:43:31.791
But...

255
00:43:35.917 --> 00:43:36.916
l don't love Ranjeet

256
00:43:36.917 --> 00:43:38.750
Ranjeet is perfect for you.

257
00:43:39.834 --> 00:43:41.208
so is it only about money?

258
00:43:42.084 --> 00:43:42.958
No.

259
00:43:43.501 --> 00:43:45.083
lt's not about money.

260
00:43:48.042 --> 00:43:51.541
He can't say the words
you wish to hear...

261
00:43:52.959 --> 00:43:55.875
and he can't hear the words
you wish to say.

262
00:43:58.751 --> 00:44:00.916
sometimes silence is
the Language of love.

263
00:44:01.334 --> 00:44:05.916
And some day that silence will
drown out your love.

264
00:44:07.501 --> 00:44:10.000
You will use your fingers to talk to him...

265
00:44:10.876 --> 00:44:13.250
but the world wiLL point fingers at you.

266
00:44:20.084 --> 00:44:21.875
Do you really love dad?

267
00:44:25.292 --> 00:44:27.458
Who said you can only love once?

268
00:44:29.959 --> 00:44:32.458
He probably doesn't even
recognise me now.

269
00:44:58.042 --> 00:44:58.333
Here.

270
00:45:04.042 --> 00:45:06.625
Come to me the next time you need money...
and I'll teach you a Lesson.

271
00:45:49.501 --> 00:45:51.750
Respected Shruti's father,

272
00:45:51.959 --> 00:45:54.625
Life is a beautiful journey...

273
00:45:54.626 --> 00:45:57.291
who knows what it has
in store for us.

274
00:45:57.501 --> 00:45:59.166
But i do Know this.

275
00:45:59.167 --> 00:46:02.375
You love your daughter a Lot.

276
00:46:02.667 --> 00:46:04.458
Your daughter loves me a lot.

277
00:46:04.459 --> 00:46:07.500
And I love your daughter a Lot.

278
00:46:07.792 --> 00:46:11.541
when there's so much
Love amongst us...

279
00:46:11.751 --> 00:46:14.500
why don't we become a family?

280
00:46:14.501 --> 00:46:15.166
Yes?

281
00:46:20.417 --> 00:46:22.875
Please get your daughter married to me.

282
00:46:23.167 --> 00:46:27.291
Our Life would then be
the perfect fairy tale.

283
00:46:27.501 --> 00:46:29.791
And, we'd all live happily ever after!

284
00:46:30.001 --> 00:46:32.291
Please say yes.

285
00:46:32.501 --> 00:46:34.666
Yours sincerely, Barfi.

286
00:46:43.751 --> 00:46:44.583
what is it?

287
00:46:47.667 --> 00:46:48.583
Let me check.

288
00:47:08.084 --> 00:47:08.958
- What is it?

289
00:47:10.459 --> 00:47:11.750
He's here for a donation.

290
00:47:12.417 --> 00:47:13.583
You see,
he's hearing and speech impaired.

291
00:47:59.042 --> 00:47:59.708
Barfi.

292
00:53:08.376 --> 00:53:12.833
Move it!

293
00:53:25.667 --> 00:53:26.291
Sit!

294
00:53:33.042 --> 00:53:33.541
Right...

295
00:53:35.126 --> 00:53:35.875
tell me.

296
00:53:45.542 --> 00:53:46.208
Jhilmil?

297
00:53:47.834 --> 00:53:49.958
He is asking about Jhilmil.

298
00:54:17.542 --> 00:54:22.041
DROP RS. 7,000 AT
THE POST OFFlCE AT 11 PM.

299
00:54:32.167 --> 00:54:33.291
who has written this?

300
00:54:35.834 --> 00:54:39.833
BRING RS. 100,000 TO
LONA KUKUR BRIDGE AT 11 PM.

301
00:54:57.417 --> 00:55:00.541
You think ll'm foolish?

302
00:55:21.459 --> 00:55:22.791
ldiot!

303
00:55:24.042 --> 00:55:25.958
Tell him to start at the beginning.

304
00:55:32.917 --> 00:55:36.041
My mother passed away
giving birth to me.

305
00:55:36.834 --> 00:55:39.666
My father is a driver.
- Stop it!

306
00:55:41.834 --> 00:55:43.208
Not from that beginning.

307
00:55:46.459 --> 00:55:48.083
Start from this point on.

308
00:56:46.459 --> 00:56:51.208
After Shruti left,
Barfi became a completely different person.

309
00:56:51.917 --> 00:56:54.666
His father lost his job.

310
00:56:56.959 --> 00:57:01.125
This happened after
Jhilmil's grandpa passed away.

311
00:57:01.126 --> 00:57:02.583
Grandpa, wake up!

312
00:57:03.126 --> 00:57:09.666
JhiLmil's grandpa left
his entire wealth to her Trust Fund.

313
00:57:10.584 --> 00:57:17.041
Jhilmil's father was left to live off
a meagre monthly allowance, like the servants.

314
00:57:18.167 --> 00:57:19.875
The arguments got worse...

315
00:57:20.876 --> 00:57:28.125
and one day he got rid of all the servants,
including the old timers.

316
00:57:28.959 --> 00:57:33.125
including Barfi's father and Jhilmil's nanny.

317
00:57:33.834 --> 00:57:39.708
he didn't consider how Jhilmil
would survive without her nanny.

318
00:58:57.917 --> 00:58:59.333
Kidney failure...

319
00:59:00.459 --> 00:59:03.041
He needs surgery.

320
00:59:04.292 --> 00:59:06.125
Seven thousand rupees...

321
00:59:15.042 --> 00:59:16.833
within two days...

322
00:59:17.417 --> 00:59:18.208
two days.

323
01:00:56.126 --> 01:00:56.916
Hello...

324
01:00:57.584 --> 01:00:58.375
Yes!

325
01:00:59.584 --> 01:01:00.958
Mr. Chatterjee...

326
01:01:01.501 --> 01:01:02.833
Good evening, sir.

327
01:01:03.917 --> 01:01:04.791
Kidnapped?

328
01:01:06.251 --> 01:01:07.333
Your daughter?

329
01:01:08.376 --> 01:01:09.625
Are you sure?

330
01:01:36.876 --> 01:01:39.333
Who was the Last to see her?

331
01:01:39.667 --> 01:01:42.416
I was reading her a bedtime story...

332
01:01:42.417 --> 01:01:46.041
If she was asleep,
how could she be kidnapped?

333
01:01:46.376 --> 01:01:48.125
For God's sake!
I received a call.

334
01:01:48.584 --> 01:01:50.666
For a ransom of 50,000 rupees!

335
01:01:50.667 --> 01:01:51.250
50,000?

336
01:01:51.251 --> 01:01:52.375
This way, please...

337
01:01:54.334 --> 01:01:55.333
Do you suspect anyone?

338
01:01:55.334 --> 01:01:57.333
I mean, do you have any enemies?

339
01:01:57.667 --> 01:01:59.291
He has several debts...

340
01:01:59.501 --> 01:02:01.208
so, yes, there are enemies.

341
01:02:01.376 --> 01:02:02.333
I'm sorry.

342
01:02:02.542 --> 01:02:04.750
Sorry, she's been drinking.
- I'm sure it is one of them.

343
01:02:04.751 --> 01:02:07.666
PLease, can you stop drinking?
I was not drinking.

344
01:02:10.376 --> 01:02:12.541
Go call the other servants.

345
01:02:12.542 --> 01:02:13.416
Take him with you.

346
01:02:15.417 --> 01:02:16.416
You tried to strangle her
when she was a child.

347
01:02:16.417 --> 01:02:17.833
why do you have to bring that up?

348
01:02:18.126 --> 01:02:18.791
How can I forget it?

349
01:02:19.001 --> 01:02:19.500
Shut up!

350
01:02:19.709 --> 01:02:20.375
You shut up!

351
01:02:54.126 --> 01:02:56.250
MR. CHATTERJEE'S DAUGHTER KIDNAPPED

352
01:05:25.126 --> 01:05:25.791
Barfi!

353
01:05:40.626 --> 01:05:43.416
Where were you?

354
01:05:44.334 --> 01:05:45.208
Where are you going?

355
01:05:45.917 --> 01:05:46.958
Mr. Dutta!

356
01:05:47.834 --> 01:05:48.916
We are late.

357
01:06:57.376 --> 01:06:58.541
Inspector Dutta, do something!

358
01:11:35.584 --> 01:11:36.333
Barfi.

359
01:11:46.834 --> 01:11:48.041
Got to pee...

360
01:12:29.792 --> 01:12:30.958
No, don't shut the door...

361
01:15:14.001 --> 01:15:16.166
DROP RS. 7,000 AT
THE POST OFFlCE AT 11 PM.

362
01:15:27.501 --> 01:15:30.833
Who goes there?

363
01:16:46.084 --> 01:17:03.208
Open the door.

364
01:18:02.209 --> 01:18:05.500
l Iooked after her for 15 years,
but you...

365
01:18:05.792 --> 01:18:07.708
Couldn't take care of her for 15 days!

366
01:18:07.876 --> 01:18:09.541
When did you get this Letter?

367
01:18:09.917 --> 01:18:11.041
l got it this morning
in the Letterbox.

368
01:18:11.251 --> 01:18:13.208
- I told you
not to take her away!

369
01:18:14.126 --> 01:18:15.833
Money is all that matters to you!

370
01:18:16.501 --> 01:18:18.708
I know what's happening here.

371
01:18:18.709 --> 01:18:19.500
What are you trying to say?

372
01:18:19.709 --> 01:18:21.125
How can you talk like that?

373
01:18:21.542 --> 01:18:23.333
You don't know the facts!

374
01:18:23.834 --> 01:18:24.833
There's a cop here.

375
01:18:25.042 --> 01:18:26.291
Yet you're saying such things.

376
01:18:28.042 --> 01:18:28.833
Inspector...

377
01:18:30.376 --> 01:18:32.291
Please investigate this thoroughly.

378
01:18:32.792 --> 01:18:34.791
- I think Jhilmil's family is involved.

379
01:24:47.376 --> 01:24:47.958
209...

380
01:24:48.126 --> 01:24:49.833
- 210?
- 210.

381
01:24:49.834 --> 01:24:51.333
- 211?
- 211.

382
01:24:52.376 --> 01:24:53.833
What is the patient's name?

383
01:24:54.709 --> 01:24:55.833
Jung Bahadur.

384
01:25:19.001 --> 01:25:23.250
Eeny Meeny Miny Moe

385
01:26:48.417 --> 01:26:50.041
Sir, the Senior Inspector wants to see you.

386
01:26:57.042 --> 01:26:57.333
Sir...

387
01:26:58.876 --> 01:26:59.958
Sir, my wife is...

388
01:27:00.667 --> 01:27:01.083
Pregnant.

389
01:27:01.292 --> 01:27:02.333
But you aren't!

390
01:27:02.626 --> 01:27:03.708
Stay here.

391
01:27:11.376 --> 01:27:12.250
Did he tell you?

392
01:27:13.709 --> 01:27:14.583
He didn't tell me.

393
01:27:16.292 --> 01:27:17.541
Did you tell him?

394
01:27:19.084 --> 01:27:20.083
I didn't tell him.

395
01:27:22.751 --> 01:27:23.708
What do we do?

396
01:27:25.084 --> 01:27:26.666
- Tell me.
You tell me, sir.

397
01:27:28.459 --> 01:27:29.250
What do we do?

398
01:27:31.167 --> 01:27:32.125
He's already here.

399
01:27:35.876 --> 01:27:37.333
Yes, sir, he is here.

400
01:27:38.459 --> 01:27:39.375
Will you go?

401
01:27:40.167 --> 01:27:41.166
Or should I?

402
01:27:44.667 --> 01:27:45.666
There's an hour to go.

403
01:27:48.626 --> 01:27:51.291
l will continue the interrogation.

404
01:27:52.251 --> 01:27:55.291
We have got two ransom notes.

405
01:27:56.667 --> 01:28:00.833
The first, for 7,000 rupees,
was written by Barfi.

406
01:28:02.959 --> 01:28:06.125
But we don't know who wrote
the second note for 100,000 rupees.

407
01:28:08.334 --> 01:28:10.916
'If your daughter's life is dear to you...

408
01:28:12.334 --> 01:28:14.375
come with 100,000 rupees to...

409
01:28:15.417 --> 01:28:18.750
Lona Kukur bridge at 11 pm.

410
01:28:19.376 --> 01:28:21.166
Otherwise the girl is dead.'

411
01:28:21.834 --> 01:28:24.541
So the Senior Inspector and Mr. Chatterjee...

412
01:28:24.751 --> 01:28:28.041
went to the bridge at 11 pm sharp.

413
01:29:31.126 --> 01:29:35.708
All night Long, many officers...

414
01:29:37.167 --> 01:29:39.000
tried to look for Jhilmil
in the lake.

415
01:29:42.209 --> 01:29:44.500
The strange thing about this case was...

416
01:29:47.917 --> 01:29:49.625
no one could identify the villain.

417
01:29:51.792 --> 01:29:54.291
lf Jhilmil were to be killed...

418
01:29:55.084 --> 01:29:56.625
Who would stand to gain?

419
01:29:59.376 --> 01:30:02.791
I continued with my interrogation.

420
01:30:04.126 --> 01:30:08.000
l was sure of getting a lead somewhere.

421
01:30:10.042 --> 01:30:11.250
l didn't get any leads.

422
01:30:12.917 --> 01:30:14.291
But what I did get...

423
01:30:15.626 --> 01:30:17.416
was emotionally shocking.

424
01:31:17.584 --> 01:31:19.291
You can't get away!

425
01:31:19.667 --> 01:31:21.458
Hey... wait!

426
01:32:46.959 --> 01:32:49.125
- Do you want to go or not?

427
01:36:58.292 --> 01:37:03.541
- Barfi...

428
01:37:23.209 --> 01:37:25.208
Barfi!

429
01:42:10.751 --> 01:42:12.708
CHATTERJEE GIRL MISSING.
KIDNAPPER ON THE RUN.

430
01:43:52.334 --> 01:43:54.250
Sorry, sir.

431
01:43:56.626 --> 01:43:58.666
The Senior Inspector wants to see you.

432
01:44:18.417 --> 01:44:19.208
Excuse me!

433
01:44:28.292 --> 01:44:29.541
Mr. Sengupta.

434
01:44:30.709 --> 01:44:31.375
waiting.

435
01:45:00.792 --> 01:45:02.958
Once again I lost my resolve
when I saw Ranjeet.

436
01:45:05.042 --> 01:45:07.541
Once again I'd left Barfi behind.

437
01:45:12.376 --> 01:45:14.750
But destiny kept bringing me
back to him.

438
01:45:15.501 --> 01:45:16.958
Yet, I don't know why...

439
01:45:18.792 --> 01:45:21.625
I never had the courage to follow my heart.

440
01:45:23.251 --> 01:45:27.083
Perhaps that's why destiny didn't favour me.

441
01:45:28.876 --> 01:45:31.333
Barfi could've taken Jhilmil anywhere.

442
01:45:33.126 --> 01:45:35.041
But destiny brought him to Kolkata.

443
01:45:37.501 --> 01:45:40.791
Or he came there intentionally.

444
01:45:43.126 --> 01:45:47.541
Because he knew I had moved to
Kolkata after my wedding.

445
01:48:15.042 --> 01:48:18.791
A...

446
01:48:26.292 --> 01:48:29.875
B...

447
01:48:30.167 --> 01:48:33.750
B for Barfi...

448
01:48:34.042 --> 01:48:36.041
Barfi...

449
01:48:36.042 --> 01:48:36.958
Barfi!

450
01:53:06.417 --> 01:53:11.000
I never imagined
Barfi would enter my life again.

451
01:53:12.876 --> 01:53:15.458
And when I met him
after all this time...

452
01:53:16.834 --> 01:53:19.833
I wasn't just meeting Barfi.

453
01:53:20.792 --> 01:53:22.250
But also the girl...

454
01:53:23.542 --> 01:53:26.083
who lost herself after
becoming Mrs. Sengupta.

455
01:55:07.959 --> 01:55:08.833
Mom once said...

456
01:55:08.834 --> 01:55:11.166
that a silence would envelope
Barfi and me.

457
01:55:11.584 --> 01:55:14.041
And that some day that
silence would drown out our love.

458
01:55:15.084 --> 01:55:19.083
But silence was all Ranjeet and I had.

459
01:55:20.126 --> 01:55:24.250
We could hear each other clearly...
but we didn't feel a thing.

460
01:55:25.042 --> 01:55:27.500
In every way we were complete...

461
01:55:27.751 --> 01:55:29.750
but our love remained incomplete.

462
01:55:31.709 --> 01:55:33.833
You could say, in some ways
Barfi was incomplete...

463
01:55:34.459 --> 01:55:36.708
but his love was complete.

464
01:59:53.251 --> 01:59:54.958
All I know is that She is from Darjeeling.

465
01:59:55.709 --> 01:59:57.916
But what about her parents?
Don't you have any other details?

466
02:00:10.626 --> 02:00:11.875
Mrs. Sengupta?

467
02:00:12.084 --> 02:00:13.500
Yes.

468
02:00:14.209 --> 02:00:16.416
Jhilmil Chatterjee's missing report?

469
02:00:16.709 --> 02:00:17.708
Yes?

470
02:00:17.917 --> 02:00:18.750
Did you report it?

471
02:00:18.751 --> 02:00:19.416
Yes.

472
02:00:41.376 --> 02:00:45.083
Jhilmil went missing three times.

473
02:00:47.417 --> 02:00:49.083
First, she was kidnapped from her home.

474
02:00:49.751 --> 02:00:53.916
The second time
Barfi took her from under our nose!

475
02:00:55.709 --> 02:00:59.875
The next six months
I didn't hear a thing.

476
02:01:01.126 --> 02:01:04.125
l assumed it was the end of the case.

477
02:01:05.876 --> 02:01:09.958
- But, Six months later,
Mr. Chatterjee called me...

478
02:01:10.792 --> 02:01:11.625
- to his house.

479
02:01:12.542 --> 02:01:14.000
- And, why did he call me?

480
02:01:15.417 --> 02:01:18.541
To give me the
1,00,000 rupee ransom note.

481
02:01:19.834 --> 02:01:20.875
Case reopened.

482
02:01:22.751 --> 02:01:26.708
But, even before I couLd get started,
I got a call from Calcutta.

483
02:01:27.751 --> 02:01:31.166
- That a certain Mrs. Sengupta in Calcutta...

484
02:01:31.167 --> 02:01:34.291
had reported Jhilmil missing.

485
02:01:35.292 --> 02:01:38.000
Jhilmil missing in Calcutta...

486
02:01:39.792 --> 02:01:41.166
and ransom note in Darjeeling.

487
02:01:41.334 --> 02:01:43.708
lt made no sense.

488
02:01:44.376 --> 02:01:48.416
Just like a bad detective novel

489
02:01:52.376 --> 02:01:52.875
Now?

490
02:01:54.459 --> 02:01:54.916
What now, sir?

491
02:01:56.251 --> 02:01:57.833
We have to tell the girl's father...

492
02:01:58.709 --> 02:02:00.333
who killed her?

493
02:02:01.334 --> 02:02:02.125
who?

494
02:02:05.251 --> 02:02:06.541
who is in our custody?

495
02:02:06.959 --> 02:02:07.666
Barfi.

496
02:02:08.501 --> 02:02:09.250
He killed Jhilmil.

497
02:02:10.501 --> 02:02:11.708
How could he have killed her...

498
02:02:12.542 --> 02:02:13.583
while he has been in our custody?

499
02:02:13.917 --> 02:02:17.791
You and l know that,
but Mr. Chatterjee doesn't.

500
02:02:18.876 --> 02:02:20.083
No.

501
02:02:20.501 --> 02:02:22.125
FundamentaLly, this is wrong, sir.

502
02:02:22.667 --> 02:02:26.000
Fundamentally, he can
dismiss us from our jobs.

503
02:02:26.751 --> 02:02:27.833
He's very powerfull.

504
02:02:28.251 --> 02:02:29.916
He can take names off school rolls.

505
02:02:29.917 --> 02:02:32.291
l don't go to school, sir.

506
02:02:32.501 --> 02:02:34.083
But your kids do.

507
02:02:34.626 --> 02:02:37.750
If you Lose your job,
how will you pay the fees?

508
02:02:38.501 --> 02:02:41.500
We'll tell Chatterjee that we arrested him
after the girl died.

509
02:02:42.417 --> 02:02:45.041
He is hearing and speech impaired.
He can't argue, simple!

510
02:02:57.376 --> 02:02:58.958
Hello... Mr. Chatterjee...

511
02:03:21.792 --> 02:03:23.416
What are you looking for?

512
02:03:24.792 --> 02:03:26.000
The Lawyer's number.

513
02:03:38.876 --> 02:03:41.583
Why don't you eat something...

514
02:03:45.876 --> 02:03:46.541
- Shruti...

515
02:03:50.542 --> 02:03:52.708
You Lied to me, mom.

516
02:03:54.876 --> 02:04:00.000
Why do you sneak out
to see that man?

517
02:04:01.876 --> 02:04:04.166
It's because you still love him.

518
02:04:06.501 --> 02:04:07.333
Don't you?

519
02:04:11.209 --> 02:04:13.291
Do you really love dad?

520
02:04:39.376 --> 02:04:41.541
- Mr. Chatterjee... don't do this.

521
02:04:43.917 --> 02:04:46.000
- Mr. Chatterjee, listen...

522
02:04:46.251 --> 02:04:48.083
Control yourself... please!

523
02:04:56.251 --> 02:04:57.166
- I request you.

524
02:04:57.376 --> 02:04:59.208
- Get a hold of yourself!

525
02:04:59.834 --> 02:05:02.833
- Barfi! Don't do that.

526
02:05:45.834 --> 02:05:46.375
Hello...

527
02:05:48.501 --> 02:05:49.083
Yes.

528
02:05:59.167 --> 02:06:00.333
Okay Inspector, I'll be there.

529
02:06:07.376 --> 02:06:08.708
Do you really have to go?

530
02:06:15.001 --> 02:06:15.708
Shruti...

531
02:06:18.417 --> 02:06:19.500
Then don't come back.

532
02:06:42.792 --> 02:06:44.000
Thank you, Mrs. Sengupta.

533
02:06:45.459 --> 02:06:47.625
I wasn't sure who to call.

534
02:06:49.376 --> 02:06:51.250
And I didn't think
anybody else would turn up.

535
02:06:53.334 --> 02:06:55.333
- We don't know who murdered Jhilmil.

536
02:06:56.167 --> 02:06:59.208
But when asked,
the cops will say he did it.

537
02:07:00.917 --> 02:07:01.875
I'll find out...

538
02:07:03.209 --> 02:07:04.625
who the real culprit is?

539
02:07:06.126 --> 02:07:07.333
But that could take some time.

540
02:07:09.834 --> 02:07:11.666
l don't have a soft corner for him.

541
02:07:13.292 --> 02:07:15.166
But I guess you do...

542
02:07:17.376 --> 02:07:19.875
- He'll get trapped, Mrs. Sengupta.

543
02:07:21.251 --> 02:07:22.583
- They are a powerful family.

544
02:07:23.834 --> 02:07:25.166
- Take him away.

545
02:07:26.667 --> 02:07:27.458
But...

546
02:07:29.251 --> 02:07:30.958
everybody deserves a second chance.

547
02:07:40.917 --> 02:07:42.541
- Here... a ticket for Calcutta.

548
02:07:42.751 --> 02:07:43.791
Thank you!

549
02:07:47.792 --> 02:07:49.250
One more ticket, please.

550
02:11:51.251 --> 02:11:52.750
l don't know why but...

551
02:11:53.917 --> 02:11:56.750
l wasn't really concerned
about Jhilmil's disappearance.

552
02:11:57.292 --> 02:11:58.500
In fact, I was happy.

553
02:12:00.376 --> 02:12:02.000
Because, finally Barfi was mine.

554
02:12:03.751 --> 02:12:05.541
But someone who loses their Love...

555
02:12:05.876 --> 02:12:09.458
and goes on with life,
who knew that better than me.

556
02:12:11.334 --> 02:12:13.666
Living with Barfi I realised that...

557
02:12:14.417 --> 02:12:15.958
l finally got my opportunity.

558
02:12:16.667 --> 02:12:18.291
But a littLe too late.

559
02:12:19.709 --> 02:12:21.958
There I was with Barfi...

560
02:12:22.584 --> 02:12:27.041
but Barfi was still devoted to Jhilmil.

561
02:13:56.584 --> 02:13:57.791
- So, you're Barfi.

562
02:13:59.126 --> 02:14:01.625
- You're here looking for Jhilmil.

563
02:14:03.209 --> 02:14:04.166
But why here?

564
02:14:05.792 --> 02:14:08.166
JhiLmil had the number of this place.

565
02:14:13.334 --> 02:14:17.041
So he thought... his last hope...

566
02:14:17.459 --> 02:14:19.291
Why would Jhilmil be here?

567
02:14:21.292 --> 02:14:22.416
It's been so long since--

568
02:14:24.417 --> 02:14:26.208
Jhilmil didn't come here.

569
02:14:28.001 --> 02:14:29.541
Please leave!

570
02:14:30.042 --> 02:14:31.041
Please go away.

571
02:14:32.334 --> 02:14:33.416
Please go!

572
02:14:35.251 --> 02:14:36.541
JhiLmiL is not here.

573
02:14:39.001 --> 02:14:40.250
JhiLmiL is not here!

574
02:14:42.167 --> 02:14:48.333
- Get him... catch him...

575
02:15:46.126 --> 02:15:47.291
Daju...

576
02:15:49.084 --> 02:15:50.083
Jhilmil...

577
02:15:55.292 --> 02:15:56.708
l hope you haven't told anyone.

578
02:15:57.834 --> 02:15:58.833
Please don't.

579
02:16:01.251 --> 02:16:04.208
- What could I do...
I was in a mess.

580
02:16:05.501 --> 02:16:08.416
I thought she'd go missing
for a few hours.

581
02:16:08.626 --> 02:16:11.583
-This was the best way to get money
from my own family!

582
02:16:12.459 --> 02:16:13.916
The debts were killing me.

583
02:16:14.667 --> 02:16:17.083
JhiLmil's grandpa made sure
I only got a measlly amount every month.

584
02:16:17.292 --> 02:16:20.250
- He left the rest of his wealth
in Jhilmil's Trust Fund.

585
02:16:22.459 --> 02:16:25.875
- This was the only way to
get funds out of the Trust.

586
02:16:28.126 --> 02:16:29.166
I made a mistake.

587
02:16:30.834 --> 02:16:32.208
A grave mistake.

588
02:16:33.417 --> 02:16:35.583
- I really care about Jhilmil, Daju.

589
02:16:36.042 --> 02:16:39.166
Will you take Jhilmil
away from here again?

590
02:16:40.209 --> 02:16:41.166
Yes.

591
02:16:41.709 --> 02:16:44.708
Her mother wouldn't want her
to be here.

592
02:16:46.209 --> 02:16:49.458
Do you still need the money?

593
02:16:54.376 --> 02:16:55.458
Jhilmil is...

594
02:16:57.167 --> 02:16:58.291
very happy here.

595
02:18:13.542 --> 02:18:16.250
Daju looked at
Barfi's attempts in silence.

596
02:18:16.917 --> 02:18:18.875
Here was Barfi...

597
02:18:19.667 --> 02:18:22.208
who cared for Jhilmil even
more than he did.

598
02:18:23.292 --> 02:18:27.083
Whether Jhilmil would stay back at Muskaan
or go away with Barfi....

599
02:18:27.584 --> 02:18:30.416
was a decision
he left to Jhilmil.

600
02:18:46.001 --> 02:18:50.291
- Barfi...

601
02:18:51.501 --> 02:18:52.583
- Barfi!

602
02:24:39.959 --> 02:24:42.166
That was the love
I always yearned for.

603
02:24:43.542 --> 02:24:45.041
Just like my grandparents.

604
02:24:46.667 --> 02:24:47.958
True love.

605
02:24:49.126 --> 02:24:51.458
To live together and die together...

606
02:24:53.084 --> 02:24:54.791
in each other's arms.

607
02:24:56.001 --> 02:24:58.041
So no ones left behind in tears.

608
02:25:01.251 --> 02:25:02.500
They left...

609
02:25:03.709 --> 02:25:04.625
together.

610
02:25:05.792 --> 02:25:08.458
Leaving me all alone.

611
02:25:11.084 --> 02:25:13.250
lt could have been me
instead of Jhilmil.

612
02:25:14.126 --> 02:25:15.791
But it was Jhilmil who got Barfi.

613
02:25:17.542 --> 02:25:20.625
Because she didn't
plan to fall in love.

614
02:25:21.209 --> 02:25:24.166
She didn't think
about the consequences.

615
02:25:25.792 --> 02:25:29.083
She didn't think
how life would turn out.

616
02:25:30.417 --> 02:25:32.875
She just loved him unconditionally.

617
02:25:33.542 --> 02:25:38.208
And it all turned out well
in the end.

617
02:26:58.142 --> 02:27:28.208
